{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_02_title", "source_sha256": "4e07b45a01f9c03b046b145cb21f1930113c6e9141dfcf9fcdcd8021205af7f0", "ja": "解夏傀儡カウントダウン留守電", "zh": "解夏傀儡倒计时留言", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e31c0ce6d0d4b15521b4d6f717ba82b64df3e9f935c2510aee09693ee5973258", "ja": "現代伝奇ホラーの撮影を控えた\r\nこのみからの留守番電話です。", "zh": "这是即将拍摄现代传奇恐怖片的\n木实打来的语音留言。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_02_1000_039kon", "source_sha256": "18ba5105f1b64298010c6275830679cd158696452dd55b591ab20f1fa78fb15f", "ja": "{$P$}……あら、留守電？\nお疲れさま、このみよ！　やっぱり忙しいのね。", "zh": "{$P$}……咦，是留言电话吗？\n辛苦啦，我是このみ！果然很忙呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_02_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "3fccd7531bf93ea3135df604f0853f21873c977b4541c2570fb1e061d039b060", "ja": "急ぎの用じゃないんだけど、\nどうしても話したくなっちゃって……ウフフ。", "zh": "虽然不是什么急事，但就是忍不住想和你聊聊……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_02_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "57ecfecc8baa3e034813b62193c2cc5d64039bd6ef641fe505ddbb816d993d1d", "ja": "だから、勝手にメッセージだけ入れておくわね。\nえっと、『彼ハ誰ノ彼岸』の台本、読んだわ！", "zh": "所以，我就自作主张地只留条消息啦。那个，我已经读过《彼ハ誰ノ彼岸》的剧本了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_02_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "70226b1df7f4bf9a3f09bda2d54090fa249260b7dc4a050e0f288e17a74c9dea", "ja": "これ、すっごくいいわね。\nなんだか、引き込まれちゃったわ。", "zh": "这个真是太棒了。\n不知不觉就被吸引进去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_02_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "14beae2bb156e1740d187c08987d542b512225e6bdf26209d8fa8f935e0814b0", "ja": "ホラーのお芝居は『CLEVER CLOVER』の\n公演でもやったけど、また雰囲気が違って……。", "zh": "虽然之前也在《CLEVER CLOVER》的公演中演过恐怖剧，但这次的氛围又有所不同……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_02_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "512e8edfd42a4a82bc42ed4ea20732ffd15624acd5522ed3971e17b61c9de1da", "ja": "山深くの小さな村とか、古くから残る因襲とか……\n守り神として奉られる少女に、超常現象でしょ？", "zh": "深山里的小村庄、自古残存至今的陈规旧俗……\n被当成守护神供奉的少女，还有超自然现象，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_02_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "99b20cf6b80cfe490f769f6fcc403df078da2a18eebb53b2d474a527e462af13", "ja": "モチーフとしてはけっこう似てると思うんだけど、\nこんなに雰囲気が変わるのね。驚いちゃった。", "zh": "作为原型来说，我觉得还挺像的，\n没想到氛围会变得这么不一样。真让人惊讶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_02_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "4a08658a1d728b54556478e7eb9cc74e9537c0707ebf1cd61874e2089cf49517", "ja": "怖いシーンも確かにあるけど、それより\n人間ドラマも注目ポイントなのよね。", "zh": "虽然确实也有些吓人的场景，但比起这些，人间戏剧才是值得关注的看点呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_02_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "1a2a3020068971d4125b432053712491af57f37f550f045657207a0ecac103fa", "ja": "療養から帰ってきた妹が別人のように変わっていて、\nそのことに主人公である姉が気づくでしょ？", "zh": "从疗养中回来的妹妹变得像另一个人一样，作为主人公的姐姐会察觉到这一点，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_02_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "77786340adfe378b4d36b77e35563a032c3a0c652eac3127596f783e60efbe0b", "ja": "その先の展開が、王道かと思ったら……って、\n{$P$}、もしかしてまだ読んでない？", "zh": "那个后续发展，本以为会是王道剧情，没想到……等等，{$P$}，你该不会还没读吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_02_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "663ee179ec1e03e973f2256113c7f9b7e56e65ebf30b4e86ef28c02da17dc347", "ja": "いけない、危うくネタバレしちゃうところだったわ！\nごめんなさいね。でも面白いから、読んでみて！", "zh": "糟了，差点就要剧透了！\n对不起呀。不过真的很精彩，你去读读看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_02_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "8ac8b4aeaf448c9e336322c9484b389fba29af76f5a0574b3a3f51915d4f5837", "ja": "その後、じっくり語り合いましょ。ふふ♪\n早く、みんなの感想も聞きたいわ。", "zh": "之后我们再好好聊聊吧。呵呵♪\n我也想早点听听大家的感想呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_02_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "5a55c20ccb4651d5905ea9146940ccc49a61814a5dbe8ffe0e894fc1322681ae", "ja": "それじゃ、また劇場でね。\nあ、忙しいのはわかるけど、無理しちゃダメよ？", "zh": "那么，剧场见。\n啊，我知道你很忙，但可别勉强自己哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
